  "title_evidence": {
   "heading": "A STATE-SUM FORMULA FOR THE ALEXANDER POLYNOMIAL 1. Introduction In [7], Jones gave a construction of the two-variable HOMFLY-PT polynomial invariant using a recursively deﬁned Markov trace on certain representations of the braid group. These representations all factor through the Iwahori-Hecke alge",
